  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Comparativo:** adjetivo + **than** (que).",
      "",
      "| Tipo de adjetivo | Regla | Ejemplos |",
      "|---|---|---|",
      "| 1 sílaba | + **-er** | tall → taller · cheap → cheaper |",
      "| 1 sílaba terminada en -e | + **-r** | nice → nicer · large → larger |",
      "| consonante-vocal-consonante | duplica | big → **bigger** · hot → hotter |",
      "| 2 sílabas en -y | -y → **-ier** | easy → easier · noisy → noisier · friendly → friendlier |",
      "| 2 o más sílabas | **more** + adj. | more expensive · more interesting |",
      "| irregulares | — | good → **better** · bad → **worse** · far → further |",
      "",
      "*This flat is bigger **than** that one.* · *Trains are more expensive **than** buses.*",
      "",
      "**Nunca** juntes las dos formas: *more bigger* ✗ → *bigger* ✓.",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *than* suena /ðən/ (débil) en la frase: *bigger than me*."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "more cheaper",
        "right": "cheaper",
        "note": "No se combinan more y -er."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "bigger that me",
        "right": "bigger than me",
        "note": "Se usa than, no that."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
